Experimental AudioGraph RNNoise realtime plugin, version 0.1.0.

Includes statically linked RNNoise v0.2 source from Xiph RNNoise tag commit
904a876dce1f9ab8860c0a5000ed151f9f6eef58. See COPYING for source copyright
and redistribution conditions, and source files for additional retained notices.

The default pretrained model 0b50c45 is a separately prepared local dependency.
Its archive and generated weight files contain no explicit model license.
The RNNoise source license does not establish permission to redistribute these
weights or binaries containing them. This package is for local experiments only.
Do not publish or distribute it until the model license is clarified.
Upstream clarification: https://github.com/xiph/rnnoise/issues/284

No runtime model download, external-model loader, or license grant is provided.
